  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNODC- HIV and AIDS Prevention-  Prison Settings in Sub-Saharan Africa 2011-2014 - UNODC HIV prevention in prisons</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNODC- Hiv - f&#xe4;ngelser i AFrika s&#xf6;der om Sahara 2011-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention aims towards furthering developing and increasing the sustainability of responses, as well as initiating a service delivery approach to HIV in prisons in benefiting countries in sub Saharan Africa based on Zambia set-up service as model. And, its lessons learned and sharing of good practices between countries through direct duplication of activity implementation and ongoing provision of technical support and assistance.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNODC har ans&#xf6;kt om f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngning av st&#xf6;d med 4,950,000 SEK fr&#xe5;n SIDA f&#xf6;r sitt &#x201d;HIV/AIDS arbete med prevention, behandling, omsorg och st&#xf6;d i f&#xe4;ngelsemilj&#xf6;er s&#xf6;der om Sahara, Afrika, 2011-214&#x201d; Projektet &#xe4;r f&#xf6;rlagt till s&#xf6;der om Sahara, Afrika i (Angola, Etiopien, Lesotho, Malawi, Mozambique, Namibia, Swazilan Tanzania (inkluderat Zanzibar), Zambia och Zimbabwe) under 2015. Insatsen syfte &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra omh&#xe4;ndertagandet/sjukv&#xe5;rden i f&#xe4;ngelser s&#xf6;der om Sahara och som ing&#xe5;r i projektet d&#xe4;rmed kommer att vara bidragsmottagare. 

Insatsens totala budget uppg&#xe5;r till 4,950,000 SEK</narrative>
  </description>
